# Unit23
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit23核心词汇

launch/lɔːntʃ/发射；发起/The company launched a new product last month.
laundry/ˈlɔːndri/洗衣店/I need to do the laundry this weekend.
law/lɔː/法律/Everyone must obey the law.
lawyer/ˈlɔːjər/律师/She works as a lawyer in a big firm.
lay/leɪ/放置；下蛋/The hen laid an egg this morning.
layer/ˈleɪeɪr/层/The cake has three layers.
lead/liːd/领导；导致/He led the team to victory.
leadership/ˈliːdərʃɪp/领导力/Good leadership is essential for success.
lean/liːn/倾斜；依靠/She leaned against the wall.
learn/lɜːrn/学习/She learns new things very quickly.
least/liːst/最少的/This is the least expensive option.
leave/liːv/离开/He left the office at 6 p.m.
lecture/ˈlektʃər/讲座/She attended a lecture on modern history.
legal/ˈliːɡl/法律的；合法的/Is it legal to park here?
leisure/ˈliːʒər/休闲/She spends her leisure time reading books.
lend/lend/借出/Can you lend me your dictionary?
length/leŋθ/长度/The length of the bridge is 500 meters.
lesson/ˈlesn/教训；课/She learned a valuable lesson from the experience.
let/let/让/Please let me know if you need help.
level/ˈlevl/水平；程度/The water level has risen this week.
liberal/ˈlɪbərəl/自由的；开明的/He has liberal views on social issues.
liberate/ˈlɪbəreɪt/解放/The country was liberated in 1949.
library/ˈlaɪbreri/图书馆/She goes to the library every weekend.
license/ˈlaɪsns/许可证/You need a license to drive a car.
lie/laɪ/说谎；躺/Don't lie to me; tell the truth.
life/laɪf/生命/Life is full of surprises.
lift/lɪft/举起；电梯/He lifted the heavy box onto the shelf.
light/laɪt/光；轻的/The room was filled with bright light.
like/laɪk/喜欢/I like reading books in the evening.
likely/ˈlaɪkli/可能的/It is likely to rain this afternoon.
limit/ˈlɪmɪt/限制/There is a speed limit of 60 km/h on this road.
line/laɪn/线；排队/Please stand in line and wait your turn.
link/lɪŋk/连接；链接/There is a link between smoking and lung cancer.
list/lɪst/清单/She made a shopping list.
listen/ˈlɪsn/听/Listen carefully to the instructions.
literature/ˈlɪtrətʃər/文学/She has a degree in English literature.
little/ˈlɪtl/小的/There is little time left.
live/lɪv/生活；活的/She lives in a small apartment.
load/loʊd/负载；装载/The truck was loaded with goods.
loan/loʊn/贷款/He took out a loan to buy a house.
local/ˈloʊkl/当地的/She works for the local government.
locate/ˈloʊkeɪt/位于/Can you locate this place on the map?
lock/lɑːk/锁/Please lock the door when you leave.
log/lɒɡ/原木；日志/He wrote the events in his log.
lonely/ˈloʊnli/孤独的/She felt lonely after her friends left.
long/lɔːŋ/长的/How long is the Great Wall?
look/lʊk/看/Look at the beautiful scenery.
loose/luːs/松的/The screw is loose; please tighten it.
lord/lɔːrd/领主/He served the lord faithfully.
lose/luːz/失去/Don't lose hope; things will get better.
